title: River & Rainbow (Emerald, Statue, Pot of Gold)
story: dungeo
description: Ride Frigid River for emerald, detour for shovel, dig statue at
  Sandy Beach, wave sceptre for rainbow, get pot of gold. Continues from
  wt-07.

---

# Restore state from wt-07 (player at Living Room with torch, lantern, bell, book, candles)
$restore wt-07

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Prepare for river journey
# Drop exorcism items and lantern, take pump for boat inflation
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Prepare for river journey]

> drop lantern

> drop bell

> drop book

> drop candles

> take pump

> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Dam Base
# Living Room -> Cellar -> Troll Room -> E-W Passage -> Deep Ravine
# -> Chasm -> N/S Passage -> Loud Room -> Damp Cave -> Dam -> Dam Base
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Navigate to Dam Base]

> down

> east

> north

> north

> east

> east

> northeast

> up

> east

> down

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Inflate boat, board, take stick from inside boat, launch
# IMPORTANT: Board WITHOUT the stick (it punctures the boat!)
# Then take the stick from inside the boat to bypass the interceptor
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Prepare boat and launch]

> inflate boat with pump

> drop pump

# Now take the stick from inside the boat - bypasses puncture check
> put stick in boat

# Board boat
> board boat

# Launch into the river
> launch

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Ride river downstream, get emerald from buoy at FR-2
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get emerald from buoy]

# FR-1 -> FR-2
> down

# Buoy is floating at FR-2
> take buoy

> open buoy

> take emerald

> drop buoy

# DEBUG: Verify we're still at FR-2 before navigating
> look

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Detour at FR-3 to get shovel from Small Cave
# FR-2 -> FR-3, land at Rocky Shore, walk to Small Cave, return to boat
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get shovel from Small Cave]

# FR-2 -> FR-3
> down

# Land at Rocky Shore (west of FR-3)
> west

> disembark

# Walk to Small Cave
> northwest

> take shovel

# Return to Rocky Shore and re-board
> south

> board boat

# Launch back onto the river
> launch

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Continue to FR-4, land at Sandy Beach, dig up statue
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Dig up statue at Sandy Beach]

# FR-3 -> FR-4
> down

# Land at Sandy Beach from FR-4
> west

# Exit the boat and take stick for later
> disembark

> take stick

# Dig 4 times to uncover the statue (need shovel in inventory)
> dig

> dig

> dig

> dig

> take statue

> drop shovel

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Walk to Aragain Falls, wave sceptre for rainbow
# Sandy Beach -> Shore -> Aragain Falls
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Wave sceptre at Aragain Falls]

> south

> south

# Wave the sharp stick (sceptre) to make the rainbow solid
> wave stick

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Cross rainbow, get pot of gold
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get pot of gold]

> east

> east

> take pot

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Return to Living Room via forest
# End of Rainbow -> Canyon Bottom -> Rocky Ledge -> Canyon View
# -> Forest Path 3 -> Forest Path 2 -> Clearing -> Forest Path 1
# -> North of House -> Behind House -> Kitchen -> Living Room
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Return to Living Room]

> southeast

> up

> up

> west

> west

> west

> south

> south

> east

> west

> west

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store treasures]

> open trophy case

> put emerald in trophy case

> put statue in trophy case

> put pot in trophy case

> drop stick

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state for next segment
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Verify state for next segment]

> inventory

> look

[END GOAL]

$save wt-08

# SUCCESS! River & Rainbow complete
# Treasures stored: emerald, statue, pot of gold
# Player in Living Room with torch
# Ready for next segment
